@page "/careers"
@attribute [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting]
<PageTitle>Careers · Tide Casa sales engineers</PageTitle>
<HeadContent><meta name="description" content="Love technology? Help businesses get their own apps. Earn 20% of eligible initial sales and 10% of recurring maintenance revenue." /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/referrals.css" /></HeadContent>
<div class="bt-unified"><SiteHeader IsBarTide="false" /><main class="referral-public">
<section class="referral-hero"><p class="bt-one-kicker">CAREERS AT TIDE CASA</p><h1>Love tech?<br />Help a business<br />take its next step.</h1><p class="bt-one-lead">Become a sales engineer. Make connections, introduce business owners to Tide Casa, and help new clients get ready for their app.</p><a class="bt-one-button" href="/account/referrals">Apply &amp; open my profile →</a><p class="referral-note">A commission opportunity. Applications and referral codes are reviewed by Tide Casa.</p></section>
<section class="referral-earn" aria-labelledby="referral-earn-heading"><p class="bt-one-kicker">GROW TOGETHER</p><h2 id="referral-earn-heading">Your introductions.<br />Your sales.</h2><div class="referral-rate-grid"><div><strong>20%</strong><span>of eligible initial sales</span><p>App setup and the optional app-store package, after any discount or refund.</p></div><div><strong>10%</strong><span>of recurring maintenance</span><p>That’s $5 for each fully paid $50 maintenance month, before any refund adjustment.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="referral-how"><h2>Here’s how it works.</h2><ol><li><strong>Meet Tide Casa.</strong><p>Sign in, tell us about yourself, and apply. We review your application and set up your sales engineer profile.</p></li><li><strong>Get your own code.</strong><p>Once approved, you receive a referral code and a link to share. Tide Casa sets any customer discount; your profile shows the exact offer.</p></li><li><strong>Make connections.</strong><p>Share your link on a flyer, in an email to someone who wants to hear from you, or in a conversation. Help clients understand the app and prepare their content.</p></li><li><strong>Follow your sales.</strong><p>Your private workspace shows verified sales and commission accrual. The customer must apply your code before checkout. Recurring maintenance from that purchase stays attributed to you.</p></li></ol></section>
<section class="referral-terms" id="commission-terms"><h2>Clear commission terms.</h2><p>Initial commission is 20% of the amount collected for app setup and any app-store package, after discounts and refunds. Maintenance commission is 10% of each collected maintenance payment. Taxes are excluded. Processor fees are not deducted from the commission basis.</p><p>Only verified payments count. Canceled or unpaid bills do not earn commission, and refunds reduce the related commission. Self-referrals are not eligible. A paused code cannot be used for new purchases; already attributed maintenance remains on your sales record.</p><p>Your workspace tracks accrued commissions, not money already sent. Payment arrangements are confirmed directly with Tide Casa; the website does not send automatic payouts or promise a payout date. Earnings depend on completed sales.</p><a class="bt-one-link" href="/account/referrals">Start my application →</a></section>
</main><SiteFooter IsBarTide="false" /></div>
